---
export const prerender = true;
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';

const lastUpdated = '2025-01-01';
const usDate = (iso: string) => {
 const [y, m, d] = iso.split('-');
 return `${m}/${d}/${y}`;
};
---

<Layout
 title="Privacy Policy. TikSaveHub"
 description="TikSaveHub privacy policy. Learn how we handle your data, cookies, and third-party services when you use our TikTok video downloader tool."
 keywords="privacy policy, tiksavehub privacy, data protection, cookie policy, tiktok downloader privacy"
 canonical="/privacy"
 ogImage="/og-privacy.png"
 skipSoftwareApp
>
 <section class="legal-section" aria-labelledby="legal-headline">
 <div class="legal-inner container-page">
 <!-- Breadcrumb -->
 <nav aria-label="Breadcrumb" class="legal-breadcrumb">
 <ol class="breadcrumb-list">
 <li>
 <a href="/"><span>Home</span></a>
 </li>
 <li aria-current="page">
 <span>Privacy Policy</span>
 </li>
 </ol>
 </nav>

 <div class="legal-header">
 <span class="section-eyebrow text-caption-mono">Legal</span>
 <h1 id="legal-headline" class="legal-title">Privacy Policy</h1>
 <p class="legal-meta">Last updated: {usDate(lastUpdated)} &middot; Effective: {usDate(lastUpdated)}</p>
 </div>

 <div class="legal-card">
 <div class="legal-content">

 <section class="legal-clause">
 <h2 class="legal-h2">1. Introduction</h2>
 <p>
 TikSaveHub ("we", "our", or "us") respects your privacy. This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, disclose, and safeguard your information when you visit our website at <a href="https://tiksavehub.com">tiksavehub.com</a> (the "Site"). Please read this policy carefully. If you do not agree with its terms, do not access the Site.
 </p>
 <p>
 We are committed to protecting your personal data and being transparent about what we collect and why.
 </p>
 </section>

 <section class="legal-clause">
 <h2 class="legal-h2">2. Information We Collect</h2>

 <h3 class="legal-h3">2.1 Information You Provide</h3>
 <p>
 We do not require you to create an account or provide personal information to use our TikTok video downloader tool. The only data you voluntarily submit is a TikTok video URL, which is processed server-side and discarded immediately after the download is generated.
 </p>

 <h3 class="legal-h3">2.2 Information Collected Automatically</h3>
 <p>
 When you visit the Site, certain information is collected automatically by our analytics and infrastructure providers:
 </p>
 <ul class="legal-list">
 <li><strong>Usage data:</strong> pages visited, time spent, referring URL, browser type and version, operating system, and device type.</li>
 <li><strong>IP address:</strong> anonymized or truncated where possible, used for aggregate analytics and abuse prevention.</li>
 <li><strong>Cookies and similar technologies:</strong> we use minimal cookies for essential functionality (theme preference) and analytics (see Section 5).</li>
 </ul>
 </section>

 <section class="legal-clause">
 <h2 class="legal-h2">3. How We Use Your Information</h2>
 <p>We use the collected information for the following purposes:</p>
 <ul class="legal-list">
 <li>To operate and maintain the TikTok video downloader service.</li>
 <li>To improve the Site based on usage patterns and feedback.</li>
 <li>To detect, prevent, and address technical issues or abuse.</li>
 <li>To comply with legal obligations.</li>
 </ul>
 <p>
 We do <strong>not</strong> sell, rent, or share your personal information with third parties for their marketing purposes. We do <strong>not</strong> store downloaded videos or the URLs you submit.
 </p>
 </section>

 <section class="legal-clause">
 <h2 class="legal-h2">4. Third-Party Services</h2>
 <p>We use the following third-party services to operate the Site:</p>
 <ul class="legal-list">
 <li><strong>Self-hosted server</strong> Our own VPS infrastructure. Server logs may contain standard request data (IP addresses, timestamps). See our Data Retention section for log handling.</li>
 <li><strong>Google Analytics</strong> Anonymized usage analytics. Google may set cookies. See <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">Google's Privacy Policy</a>.</li>
 <li><strong>Monetag</strong> Advertising partner. May set cookies and collect usage data for ad personalization. See <a href="https://monetag.com/privacy-policy/" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">Monetag's Privacy Policy</a>.</li>
 </ul>
 <p>
 These third parties have their own privacy policies governing the use of your data. We encourage you to review them.
 </p>
 </section>

 <section class="legal-clause">
 <h2 class="legal-h2">5. Cookies</h2>
 <p>
 We use cookies and similar tracking technologies only where necessary. Here is what we use:
 </p>
 <ul class="legal-list">
 <li><strong>Essential cookies:</strong> stores your theme preference (light/dark mode). No personal data is stored.</li>
 <li><strong>Analytics cookies:</strong> set by Google Analytics to measure page views and user behavior. You can opt out via the <a href="https://tools.google.com/dlpage/gaoptout" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">Google Analytics opt-out browser add-on</a>.</li>
 </ul>
 <p>
 You can control cookies through your browser settings. Disabling essential cookies may affect site functionality.
 </p>
 </section>

 <section class="legal-clause">
 <h2 class="legal-h2">6. Data Retention</h2>
 <p>
 We retain anonymized analytics data indefinitely for trend analysis. Video URLs submitted through the download tool are processed in real time and are not stored on our servers. Server logs containing IP addresses are retained for a maximum of 30 days.
 </p>
 </section>

 <section class="legal-clause">
 <h2 class="legal-h2">7. Data Security</h2>
 <p>
 We implement appropriate technical and organizational measures to protect your data against unauthorized access, alteration, disclosure, or destruction. All data transmission between your browser and our servers is encrypted using TLS. However, no method of transmission over the Internet is 100% secure, and we cannot guarantee absolute security.
 </p>
 </section>

 <section class="legal-clause">
 <h2 class="legal-h2">8. Your Rights</h2>
 <p>Depending on your jurisdiction, you may have the following rights regarding your personal data:</p>
 <ul class="legal-list">
 <li><strong>Right to access</strong> Request a copy of the data we hold about you.</li>
 <li><strong>Right to rectification</strong> Request correction of inaccurate data.</li>
 <li><strong>Right to erasure</strong> Request deletion of your data.</li>
 <li><strong>Right to restrict processing</strong> Request limitation of how we use your data.</li>
 <li><strong>Right to data portability</strong> Request transfer of your data to another service.</li>
 <li><strong>Right to object</strong> Object to processing based on legitimate interests.</li>
 </ul>
 <p>
 To exercise any of these rights, please contact us using the information in Section 11. We will respond to your request within 30 days.
 </p>
 </section>

 <section class="legal-clause">
 <h2 class="legal-h2">9. Children's Privacy</h2>
 <p>
 The Site is not directed to individuals under the age of 13 (or the applicable age of digital consent in your jurisdiction). We do not knowingly collect personal information from children. If we become aware that a child has provided us with personal data, we will delete it promptly. If you believe a child has submitted data to us, please contact us.
 </p>
 </section>

 <section class="legal-clause">
 <h2 class="legal-h2">10. Changes to This Policy</h2>
 <p>
 We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. Changes will be posted on this page with an updated "Last updated" date. We encourage you to review this policy periodically. Continued use of the Site after changes constitutes acceptance of the revised policy.
 </p>
 </section>

 <section class="legal-clause">
 <h2 class="legal-h2">11. Contact Us</h2>
 <p>
 If you have any questions, concerns, or requests regarding this Privacy Policy, you can reach us at:
 </p>
 <p class="legal-contact">
 <strong>Email:</strong> <a href="mailto:support@tiksavehub.com">support@tiksavehub.com</a>
 </p>
 </section>

 </div>
 </div>

 <!-- Back to home -->
 <div class="legal-back">
 <a href="/" class="btn-primary-sm">&larr; Back to TikSaveHub</a>
 </div>
 </div>
 </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  /* ─── Legal Section ─── */
  .legal-section {
    background-color: var(--color-canvas-soft);
    padding: var(--spacing-5xl) var(--spacing-lg);
  }

  .legal-inner {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--spacing-2xl);
    max-width: 760px;
    margin-inline: auto;
  }

  /* Breadcrumb */
  .legal-breadcrumb {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .breadcrumb-list {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 6px;
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    font-size: var(--text-body-sm);
    color: var(--color-mute);
  }

  .breadcrumb-list li + li::before {
    content: '/';
    margin-right: 6px;
    color: var(--color-hairline-strong);
  }

  .breadcrumb-list a {
    color: var(--color-body);
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: color 0.15s ease;
  }

  .breadcrumb-list a:hover {
    color: var(--color-ink);
  }

  /* Header */
  .legal-header {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--spacing-sm);
  }

  .section-eyebrow {
    color: var(--color-mute);
  }

  .legal-title {
    font-size: var(--text-display-xl);
    font-weight: 600;
    line-height: 1.05;
    letter-spacing: -2.5px;
    color: var(--color-ink);
    margin: 0;
  }

  .legal-meta {
    font-size: var(--text-body-sm);
    color: var(--color-mute);
    margin: 0;
  }

  /* Card */
  .legal-card {
    background-color: var(--color-canvas);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    padding: var(--spacing-3xl);
    box-shadow:
      inset 0 0 0 1px #0000000a,
      0px 1px 1px #00000005,
      0px 4px 8px #0000000a;
  }

  /* Content */
  .legal-content {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--spacing-2xl);
  }

  .legal-clause {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--spacing-md);
  }

  .legal-h2 {
    font-size: var(--text-display-md);
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: -1.28px;
    color: var(--color-ink);
    margin: 0;
    line-height: 1.25;
  }

  .legal-h3 {
    font-size: var(--text-body-md-strong);
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--color-ink);
    margin: 0;
    line-height: 1.4;
  }

  .legal-content p {
    font-size: var(--text-body-md);
    color: var(--color-body);
    line-height: 1.75;
    margin: 0;
    letter-spacing: -0.1px;
  }

  .legal-list {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--spacing-sm);
  }

  .legal-list li {
    font-size: var(--text-body-md);
    color: var(--color-body);
    line-height: 1.7;
    padding-left: 20px;
    position: relative;
    letter-spacing: -0.1px;
  }

  .legal-list li::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    top: 9px;
    width: 6px;
    height: 6px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--color-grad-develop-start), var(--color-cyan));
  }

  .legal-content a {
    color: var(--color-link);
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 2px;
    transition: color 0.15s ease;
  }

  .legal-content a:hover {
    color: var(--color-link-deep);
  }

  .legal-contact {
    background-color: var(--color-canvas-soft);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    padding: var(--spacing-lg);
    font-size: var(--text-body-md);
    color: var(--color-body);
    line-height: 1.75;
  }

  .legal-contact strong {
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--color-ink);
  }

  /* Back link */
  .legal-back {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .btn-primary-sm {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: var(--spacing-xs);
    padding: var(--spacing-xs) var(--spacing-lg);
    border-radius: var(--radius-full);
    background-color: var(--color-ink);
    color: var(--color-on-primary);
    font-size: var(--text-body-sm);
    font-weight: 500;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: opacity 0.2s ease, transform 0.2s ease;
    border: none;
    cursor: pointer;
    line-height: 2.2;
    letter-spacing: -0.1px;
  }

  .btn-primary-sm:hover {
    opacity: 0.85;
    transform: translateY(-1px);
  }

  /* Dark mode overrides */
  .dark .legal-card {
    box-shadow:
      inset 0 0 0 1px #ffffff0a,
      0px 1px 1px #00000010,
      0px 4px 8px #00000020;
  }

  .dark .legal-contact {
    background-color: var(--color-canvas-soft-2);
  }

  /* Responsive */
  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .legal-section {
      padding: var(--spacing-4xl) var(--spacing-md);
    }

    .legal-title {
      font-size: 32px;
      letter-spacing: -1.5px;
    }

    .legal-card {
      padding: var(--spacing-lg);
    }

    .legal-h2 {
      font-size: var(--text-display-sm);
    }

    .breadcrumb-list {
      font-size: var(--text-caption);
    }
  }
</style>
